            <div type="translation" xml:lang="en" resp="#AA">
                <p>To Quintus Terentius Senecio Fannianus, son of Gaius, of tribe Velina, quinquennial duovir, pontifex, having dedicated an Augusteum and having given an epulum. [This was dedicated by] the colonists and the inhabitants.</p>
